<title>JAPAN: Sumitomo Life names new president.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Life names new president.</headline>
<dateline>OSAKA, Japan 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sumitomo Life Insurance Co said on Tuesday that executive managing director Koichi Yoshida is expected to succeed Toshiomi Uragami as president on July 2.</p>
<p>Uragami will become the company's chairman, a spokesman for Sumitomo Life Insurance said.</p>
